  <book code="2TI" style="id">EN_CLT cua_Tiếng⋅Co_ltr Thu Feb 13 2025 16:48:18 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">2 Timothy</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thư Ti-mô-thê Thưq vaarq</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Ti-mô-thê</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Ti</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Ti-mô-thê</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Phao-lô, adro jah rơơlh ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu vii xuum trôôch ku Kơy Plêêk, tyauq apok tavek truh varơuq riirh đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, <verse eid="2TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />atăq ka Ti-mô-thê, koot xung xiaq ku gô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 1:2">Apôôy koot jah vanong plêêk, varơuq biit angơuq ji hrok hrol xing Kơy Plêêk, laa Vaq ji Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, Lôôk haay.<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />Gô tưp apok kuh kway Kơy Plêêk, Kơy gô hơu varơuq xatyauq xing khơl mo kơy, dii xuum klaak pa xarêh, tuôôy klôôy hngơy gô hloay văch truh koot đom kaluh apok apôôy ku gô, <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />takôô trôôch tavơh koot, văch truh daak mot koot, xôq gô jah galơh galaay xuum hlah, <verse eid="2TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />vii e varơuq panhăk văch truh xuum tuôq dong dik đom koot, laa xuum tuôq tuôôy kapa tep măn đom Lô-it, mo pa iir miq koot, yôôch Ơ-nit, miq koot, gô tuôq đaneq xuum tuôq nưq kung đong măn đom koot.<verse eid="2TI 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />đơu vii kakơq nưq, gô panhăk koot dayh atuut hlê vanong ku Kơy Plêêk laa vanong măn đom koot xing varơuq xôq ti ku gô. <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Vii Kơy Plêêk heq be kahniq ka haay danưng kooy ku varơuq yôq kamo, đơu laa ku paraat kalh, ku xuum xung xiaq ji varơuq jư xăk. <verse eid="2TI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Lunưq, koot te kamưưl truh varơuq dơơp xanưk ka Lôôk haay, kung te kamưưl truh gô, adro tu ku Kadraq, tađôôy muut đnư, dayh kung chiuq pơơl vii Hêêl Kaxay, gamưh taay yaak ku Kơy Plêêk, <verse eid="2TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />Kơy heq wơơt haay ji tawooyh taayh haay bơơn varơuq tawooyh taayh vah, leh aalq tyauq varơuq dơơp ku haay, bơh tyauq iq trôôch ku đêh Kadraq ji tyauq vanong plêêk, laa varơuq heq jah kahniq ka haay đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu xing adroyq tôôy đơơy miet miet, <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />đơu juneq heq jah kahnoq vlôh xing varơuq rama vlôh ku Wơơt Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, tuôôy heq dơơp ka varơuq kaxêêt jêêk vlôh paq ik yuôôr aar đơu ataak tađnah varơuq riirh kung varơuq leh kaxêêt gamưh Hêêl Kaxay, <verse eid="2TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />vii Hêêl Kaxay nưq đơu gô heq jah rơơlh laa adro padoh taboon, adro jah rơơlh, ji thơy pato. <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />Kung vii kakơq nưq đơu gô chiuq pơơl hwơơl dii kaluh varơuq neq. Bơh gô leh kamưưl vii gô xet Kơy gô tuôq ji gô tuôq kajưk đaneq Kadraq e qwuyen jư 'yo varơuq pahnăp ku gô dong truh hngơy nưq.<verse eid="2TI 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Koot dayh jư xok pheep tăk truh kaluh apok pato kaxay tamaq đơu koot heq tameng aduq gô, dii xuum tuôq ji xuum xung xiaq đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />Dayh jư 'yo varơuq pahnăp tolh kaxay gamưh Lôôk Phool Hiel, laa Kơy riirh đom haay.<verse eid="2TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />Koot xet varơuq neq, nưq laa dêq hloay khơl adro aduq A-si heq chôôyq ka'lăk gô, đơu đom nưq e Phi-gen ji Het-mô-gen.<verse eid="2TI 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Apôôy Lôôk kahniq vanong biit angơuq ka hnhư Ô-nê-si-phô-rơ, vii ay 'ngưng yưk hlơq hlôôp gô ji leh kamưưl truh talơy looy tooy ku gô, <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />wih hlê, tuôôy măn aduq Rô-ma, ay heq talăng jăk vôôch axek truh gô ji heq akhiim hloq. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Apôôy Lôôk kahniq vanong ka ay xôq akhiim jah varơuq biit angơuq xing aduq Kadraq đom hngơy nưq. Măn koot xet ro ay nưq heq hơu varơuq 'ngưng đaleq aduq Ê-phê-sô.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Lunưq, koot gô lơơy, koot dayh xôq koot jah kalh paraat đom vanong plêêk aduq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />Kaluh varơuq koot heq tameng xing aduq gô katul 'ngưng manih dơơp xanưk, dayh pahnăp oot ka khơl adro đangq tuôq gamưh đơu oot kung hnoq e paraat xôq pato dayq khơl drơy. <verse eid="2TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />Dayh kung chiuq pơơl hwơơl dii gô, đaji muuyq adro kuun jooy ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Tuôôy dơơp adro kuun, leh akơyq xôq ni biq măk tawaq kaluh varơuq ku đơơy riirh varơuq đơơy, xôq ka adro kuun nưq hnoq ik dơơp hlah xuum manih heq rơơlh taayh ni. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Kung anưq, tuôôy akơyq nưq truh ta thi, adro nưq hnoq leh jah đoat raak jah jay atoh leh ta thi tyauq ganuun. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Manih dơơp nôông wêêt garơng pheq jah xok raak play adroyq nhưk. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Dayh biit hlê varơuq gô đong đnooy, vii Lôôk hnoq kahniq ka koot varơuq hlolh xet đom tôôy varơuq.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />Dayh văch truh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, heq jah khienq riirh hlê xing aduq kaxêêt, thuôk adrơơk Đa-vik, tyauq đaji Hêêl Kaxay ku gô, <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />vii Hêêl Kaxay nưq, gô chiuq pơơl truh nôôy taway talơy looy tooy đaji muuyq adro lôp kadrôôp. Lunư, apok Kơy Plêêk yôôych leh biq vek jư 'leq. <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Vii anưq, gô chiuq uunq tôôy varơuq vii khơl adro jah rơơlh xok, xôq oot kung hnoq ik jah varơuq wơơt xok đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, kung dii tađnah tađnaak đơơy đơơy.<verse eid="2TI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Apok neq laa đangq tuôq gamưh:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:11">“Vii atoh haay heq kaxêêt dii Kadraq, yôôych haay kung hnoq riirh dii Kadraq.<verse eid="2TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />Atoh haay chiuq uunq ik, yôôych haay kung hnoq dưk xakaq dii Kadraq.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">Atoh haay chôôyq Kadraq, yôôych Kadraq kung hnoq chôôyq haay.<verse eid="2TI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />Atoh haay leh muuyq xuum, yôôych Kadraq kung kưq jư apok,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:13">vii Kadraq leh ik chôôyq kadih Kadraq.”<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Dayh panhăk khơl tuôq kaluh varơuq nưq, tuôôy đnooy pato oot kangưưr Kơy Plêêk xôq te takaay tayaat truh chư valơk, vii be lơơy ich kajoq, vơ taway truh varơuq hư hlơơp đôôyq dii manih tameng. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />Dayh dơơp dêq paraat xôq kahnoq vlôh kadih xăk koot đaji adro jah xanưk nhonq kangưưr Kơy Plêêk, muuyq adro dơơp kông leh kamưưl, pato dayq klip troq apok varơuq dik. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />Panưh kadrơy, dayh chuh kaluh varơuq tagêh bơyq ba leh e, vii varơuq nưq hnoq taway truh aduq leh kuh kul iaq đnoyq, <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />ji apok tagêh ku khơl adro nưq hnoq jêêk yuôôr varơuq taba lơy dang đaji ple oop hlek, đơu đom sôôq nưq laa Hi-mê-nê ji Phi-lêt, <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />khơl adro heq hooy hyaak xangưưy đôôyq dii varơuq dik, tuôôy đnooy đaneq varơuq riirh hlê heq xalih vlôh yôôch, ji oot đong pahyaak ka'lăk xuum tuôq ku muuyq sôôq adro. <verse eid="2TI 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Lunư, kahnier găk kajưk ku Kơy Plêêk heq dưk kajưk, tuôôy e apok hlêêl xanưk neq: “Lôôk xet khơl adro thuôk xuq Kadraq” ji “Dêq hloay akơyq apôôy taayh yal Lôôk pheq chuh xangưưy klơlh varơuq leh hyioh jăk.”<verse eid="2TI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Panưh kadrơy, đom muuyq poop hnhư kôt, leh vơ e wo bơơn vajang ji baak, đơu măn bơơn gay ji vari dôôp, muuyq sôôq deng ka varơuq kôt galơh, đơu sôôq kadrơy deng ka varơuq de. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Lunưq, atoh akơyq heq pa xarêh xăk klơlh kaluh varơuq nưq, yôôych adro nưq hnoq laa poop wo deng ka varơuq kôt galơh, heq jah xôq đêh vlôh, ik yuôôr đôôyq dii kôôch, jah ralauq xôq 'miêh ka tôôy varơuq kaxay.<verse eid="2TI 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />Dayh xadăk klôônq kaluh hmưch trôôch ku tadăp blaay, đơu charơơk tyauq varơuq hyioh jăk, xuum tuôq, xuum xung xiaq, kung varơuq tagu dii khơl adro apôôy taayh Lôôk bơơn xuum klaak pa xarêh. <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Bơh dayh chôôyq ka'lăk kaluh apok tagêh vlô khưrq ji biit ahyaal, vii xet đaneq kaluh varơuq nưq vơ dơơp vlôh varơuq takaay tayaat. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />Adro xapok ku Lôôk pheq leh takaay tayaat, bơh pheq tagu đôôyq dii tôôy adro, e paraat pato dayq, atuq xuum, <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />tuôôy vơ dăt khơl adro tachơơl hlê xăk dii varơuq hwêêt xuum, xet 'leq Kơy Plêêk kahniq ka oot varơuq wiit xuum wih truh varơuq hlolh xet varơuq dik, <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />ji oot hnoq ik kadrăch hlê klơlh xađook ku kamuuych, atêq tuôôy biq ni rôp jư xôq dơơp tyauq iq ni.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />Bơh koot pheq xet varơuq neq, nưq laa đom kaluh hngơy lôôch dik, hnoq xalih truh kaluh katuôôy xanưm pơơl hwơơl. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Vii khơl drơy hnoq xiaq xăk, xiaq baak jêêt, pa ưưt akhwoak, atok xăk, katơơk galơh, leh tameng apok miq vaq, leh xet ơơn, leh vah xarêh, <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />leh xet xung xiaq, leh ik tagu, ragơy đnooy xơuq, leh jư xăk, e xuum trôôch tađnưk tađnayh, leh xiaq trôôch varơuq kaxay, <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />xalih xuum, dayh tôq jaraq, atok xuum katơơk galơh, xiaq xa agưt iaq xiaq Kơy Plêêk, <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />e kaveeh tuôq kuh kul, bơh laay chôôyq ka'lăk taay yaak ku varơuq tuôq kuh kul. Dayh chuh xangưưy khơl adro nưq.<verse eid="2TI 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Vii đom katul oot laa khơl adro leenq muut hnhư khơl drơy, adô luut khơl drê vlô khưrq, rahloot viik kadrôôp maroh, biq jarooy aluut xing đu thưq hmưch trôôch, <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />hok miet đơu be dong leq hnoq ik hooy truh aduq hlolh xet varơuq dik. <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />Jan-net ji Jam-be heq tachơơl hlê Môi-se đaleq, yôôych khơl adro neq kung đong tachơơl hlê varơuq dik đanưq, bing adro nưq laa khơl adro e xuum biit biq va ih va oop, laa khơl adro pa ôôh lar đôôyq dii xuum tuôq. <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Bơh oot hnoq leh hooy xangưưy iaq ik, vii varơuq vlô khưrq ku oot hnoq jêêk vlôh ro raang adroyq tôôy manih, kung dang đaji varơuq vlô apoop ku vaarq adro hơq heq kahnoq vlôh.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Bơh koot heq dơơp tyauq apok pato, kach riirh, muk đik, xuum tuôq, varơuq atuq xuum, xuum xung xiaq, varơuq wêêt kajưk ku gô, <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />kaluh varơuq rôp toop, kaluh pơơl dal đaji heq xalih truh ka gô aduq An-ti-ôt, aduq I-kô-ni, aduq Lit-trơ, kaluh varơuq rôp toop đơu gô heq chiuq. Ji Lôôk heq wơơt xok gô klơlh dêq hloay kaluh varơuq nưq. <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />Đơu dik, dêq hloay khơl akơyq xung riirh kach tuôq kuh kul đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu raay hnoq biq rôp toop. <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />Măn bing manih xơk tauq ji adro aluut pa ôôh hnoq kang athêêp tok varơuq xơuq 'ngưng iaq, aluut pa ôôh manih ji biq manih aluut pa ôôh. <verse eid="2TI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Lunư, koot dayh kưq măn đom kaluh varơuq đơu koot heq hok ji tuôq kajưk, vii xet koot heq hok kaluh varơuq nưq xing aduq akơyq, <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />ji đaneq xing tuôôy măn de, koot heq hok xet Rahlăp Vah, hnoq ik khienq koot khôôt xet wih truh varơuq wơơt xok xing xuum tuôq đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu.<verse eid="2TI 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Kaah Rahlăp Vah laa varơuq khuh hơơy ku Kơy Plêêk, ji laa varơuq ich lơơy ka varơuq pato dayq, đnooy toah, 'meq dook, pato đom varơuq hyioh jăk, <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />xôq manih ku Kơy Plêêk hnoq ik vlôh yuôôr xaleep, jah ralauq xôq đu tol ka tôôy varơuq kaxay.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />Gô kôk kalh đnooy pato koot kangưưr Kơy Plêêk ji Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, Kơy hnoq xưh xadrah manih riirh hloay manih kaxêêt, vii varơuq rama truh ku Kadraq ji daak Kadraq, đaneq: <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />Dayh padoh taboon Apok Lôôk; dayh ralauq 'miêh, ju đom varơuq hlơu klêq long varơuq pơơl hwơơl; dayh toah dook, đnooy toah, đnooy panhăk, dii dêq hloay varơuq atuq xuum ji pato dayq. <verse eid="2TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Vii hnoq truh katuôôy xanưm tuôôy khơl drơy hnoq leh chiuq ik apok pato kaxay tamaq. Tađôôy muut đnư, oot hnoq anguk hlê ka oot khơl thơy pato tyauq varơuq hmưch trôôch đêh ku oot, dong đol ahmoot troop tôôr, <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />yôôch hnoq leh vơ kajet tôôr vlôh klơlh varơuq dik, đơu măn wih hlê kaluh varơuq taboon leh e. <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Bơh koot dayh talăng jăk đom tôôy varơuq. Dayh chiuq uunq pơơl hwơơl. Dayh dơơp kông varơuq ku manih padoh taboon Hêêl Kaxay. Dayh dơơp payôôch varơuq dơơp ku koot.<verse eid="2TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Măn gô yôôych đong biq kahrôq vlôh đaji muuyq kua lêh yôôch, ji kawat vlôh hooy ku gô heq jeq. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />Gô heq tahmơt đom muuyq varơuq ta thi tolh kaxay; gô heq payôôch varơuq charơơk; gô heq jư kajưk xuum tuôq. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Juneq, đoat tađnah hyioh jăk heq deng 'miêh ka gô, 'ngưq đoat tađnah đơu Lôôk, Kơy Padrok Xadrah hyioh jăk, hnoq kahniq kadrool ka gô đom hngơy nưq, đơu leh vơ deng ka gô, bơh măn ka dêq hloay khơl adro xung xiaq varơuq rama truh ku Kadraq.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Dayh raanq dêq paraat xôq meel truh tavơh gô, <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />vii Đê-ma heq ka'lăk gô, vii hmưch xiaq đơơy neq, ji ni heq hooy truh Tê-sa-lô-ni-ka. Kơ-rêt-xen hooy Ga-la-ti, Tit hooy Đa-ma-ti. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Vơ e Lu-ka măn dii gô. Atêq tuôôy đoonq Maak, dayh jarooy ay nưq tyauq kung koot bơyh vii ay nưq e ich ka gô đom varơuq dơơp. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />Gô heq patăk Ti-chi-kơ truh Ê-phê-sô. <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />Tuôôy hooy, koot dayh adrơk tyauq poop aau kot kek đơu gô xôq măn aduq Ka-but aduq theng Trô-ach, kung dii taleq rahloot rahlăp, nhưk laa kaluh rahloot rahlăp kađuh.<verse eid="2TI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Ti thơq đông A-lek-xan-đơ heq dơơp ra ơơh gô 'ngưng yưk. Lôôk hnoq bla hlê ni xatyauq kaluh varơuq dơơp ku ni, <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />laa adro đơu koot kung pheq rơơt rol, vii ni dêq paraat tachơơl hlê apok pato ku haay.<verse eid="2TI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />Đom yưk đnooy bing adroyq dik ku gô, be akơyq truh kahnoq kung gô, bơh dêq hloay raay hooy ka'lăk gô. Apôôy kadrôôp nưq leh kahrôq hlê tol oot. <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Bơh Lôôk heq dưk gah gô ji dơơp ka gô kalh paraat, xôq gamưh gô, varơuq đnooy vlôh Hêêl Kaxay jah dưk dơơp xaleep, ji dêq hloay tamooy kadrơy raay e hnoq tameng ik. Gô kung heq jah wơơt klơlh huuy ôô vomq. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Lôôk hnoq wơơt xok gô klơlh tôôy varơuq xơuq ji hnoq jư 'yo gô ka daak plêêk ku Kadraq. Apôôy tađnah tađnaak thuôk xuq Kadraq dong truh đơơy đơơy, miet miet. Amen.<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />Dayh vôôch hlơq Bê-rit-sin ji A-qui-la, kung dêq hloay hnhư Ô-nê-si-phô-rơ. <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Ê-rat măn hlê aduq Kô-rinh-tô, măn Trô-phim vii jiq lunưq gô xôq hlê aduq Mi-lê. <verse eid="2TI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Dayh raanq dêq paraat truh adroyq xiêk ka oaq. Ơ-bu-lu, kung Bu-đen, Li-nut, Kơ-lau-đia, ji khơl oh ay raay vôôch hlơq koot.<verse eid="2TI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Apôôy Lôôk măn dii danưng kooy koot. Apôôy vanong plêêk măn dii oh ay.<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>